      "translation": "Dante loves tall buildings. “Wow! So tall!” He takes out his map. “Let’s go!”",
      "translations": [
        "Dante loves tall buildings. “Wow! So tall!” He takes out his map. “Let’s go!”",
        "In 2027, he will go to New York to see One World Trade Center. It looks like a big pencil! He will also see the JPMorgan Chase Headquarters. It looks like stacked blocks!",
        "In 2028, he will go to Shanghai to see Shanghai Tower. It looks like swirly ice cream! He will also see Jin Mao Tower. It is big at the bottom and small at the top!",
        "In 2029, he will go to Dubai to see the Burj Khalifa. It is tall and thin. It almost touches the clouds!",
        "In 2030, he will go to Malaysia to see the Petronas Twin Towers. They look like twins holding hands with a little bridge!",
        "Dante smiles. “Tall buildings are fun!”"
      ],
